# mcp__supervisor_receipt_record — supervisor/receipt_record

Record one check result for a criterion, bound to the current candidate. Caller-asserted: the server does not observe the command, and the receipt is stored and journaled as mcp-asserted.

## Schema
```ts
type Args = {
  claim_supported: boolean;
  command: string;
  criterion: string;
  cwd: string;
  exit_code: number | null;
  output_ref: string;
};
```
Execute by writing JSON to xd://mcp__supervisor_receipt_record.

